672 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( \050Go\054 SQLite\054 SvelteKit 5\054 Docker\054 Caddy\051\nBuilt a self\055hosted cloud storage system in Go and SvelteKit 5 with session\055based authentication \050bcrypt\054 HttpOnly cookies\051\054 storage quotas enforced via transactional reservation\054 and View\057Edit folder sharing\056\nDesigned a single\055origin Caddy reverse\055proxy architecture so HttpOnly sessions work\054 and built a chunked two\055phase file upload pipeline\056\nImplemented a sliding\055window rate\055limiting middleware\054 and covered the storage layer with automated tests \05067\045 coverage\051\056\nSet up GitHub Actions CI\057CD \050golangci\055lint\054 govulncheck\054 go test\054 Vitest\051 with a self\055hosted runner deploying to a home server via Docker Compose\056\n\n)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 677 0 R
     /Pg 670 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

