674 0 obj
  << /ActualText ( \050Node\056js\054 Express\054 MySQL\054 MongoDB\051\n1st Place \055 Best WebPII Project Award \0502025\05726\051\054 team of 3\056\nBuilt the REST API backend \050MVC architecture\054 CRUD endpoints\051 for a municipal support platform\056\nDesigned a dual\055database architecture using MySQL for domain entities and MongoDB for high\055frequency logs and smart locker telemetry\056\nImplemented JWT authentication with access\057refresh tokens and role\055based access control \050RBAC\051\056\nRan performance testing of the API with JMeter\056\n\nHonors \046 awards\n\n1st Place \055 TeamGreen4All Hackathon \050IPP\055Wide Competition\054 May 2026\051\n1st Place \055 Best WebPII Project Award \0502025\05726\051\n1st Place \055 3\056\252 Edi\347\343o Concurso de Programa\347\343o madJS \050May 2025\051\n1st Place \055 ESMAD Best Project Award \0502024\05725\051\nInvited Speaker \055 ESMAD Seminar\072 \042Sucesso Acad\351mico em Contexto de Grupos de Trabalho\042 \050Academic Success in Group Work Contexts\051 \050Mar 2026\051\n\nEducation\015\n\nB\056Sc\056 in Web Information Systems \046 Technologies \174 ESMAD \057 Polit\351cnico do Porto \0502024 \055 Present\051 \055 Current Grade 18\05608\05720\nCurso Avan\347ado em Desenho e Programa\347\343o Web \174 MasterD \0502023 \055 2025\051 \055 Grade\072 20\05720 \05098\045\051  \nCurso Profissional de Instrumentista \174 M\372sico de Sopro e Percuss\343o \0502020 \055 2023\051  \n\nLanguages\n\nPortuguese\072 Native\015\nEnglish\072 C1 \055 Upper Intermediate)
     /K [ 4 ]
