678 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Gabriel Paiva\015\nWEB INFORMATION SYSTEMS \nAND TECHNOLOGIES STUDENT \n\n\053351 926 945 169 \174 mr\056sousapaiva\100gmail\056com \174 github\056com\057Gabriel\055S\055Paiva \174 linkedin\056com\057in\057gabriel\055s\055paiva\015\n \nSummary\n\nHigh\055achieving Web Information Systems and Technologies student at ESMAD\057IPP with a strong focus on backend systems\054 REST APIs\054 and modern web software\056 Winner of 4 coding competitions and hackathons with hands\055on experience building self\055hosted applications and dual\055database web APIs\056\n\nTechnical skills\n\nLanguages\072 JavaScript \050ES6\053\051\054 TypeScript\054 Go\054 Python\054 SQL \050MySQL\051\054 HTML5\054 CSS3\054 PHP\nBackend \046 Systems\072 Go\054 Node\056js\054 Express\054 REST APIs\054 MySQL \050Sequelize\051\054 MongoDB \050Mongoose\051\054 SQLite\054 JWT\054 Server\055Side Sessions\nFrontend \046 Design\072 SvelteKit 5\054 Vue\056js \050Pinia\051\054 Three\056js \057 Rapier\056js\054 Tailwind CSS\054 Bootstrap\054 Figma \050UI\057UX prototyping\051\nDevOps \046 Testing\072 Docker\054 Docker Compose\054 Caddy\054 GitHub Actions \050CI\057CD\051\054 go test\054 JMeter\054 Vitest\054 Selenium\054 Git\054 Linux\nAlso familiar with\072 Python \050pandas\054 NumPy\054 scikit\055learn\051\054 Arduino\054 MinIO\n\nProjects\n\n)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 677 0 R
     /Pg 670 0 R
